OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings severe
OL,6,Fgales, particularly to the Moray coast
OL,7,Fthrough the middle of the day.
OL,8,FFrequent showers or longer spells of
OL,9,Fheavy rain, drier interludes
OL,10,Fdeveloping later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,13,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,14,Fbreezy with rain later. Very windy on
OL,15,FTuesday with showers, mainly west and
OL,16,Fsome heavy. Mainly dry and bright
OL,17,FWednesday, some showers in west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
